00:00:50.043 --> 00:00:53.897
So anyway, I went in
today, got some goodies.

00:00:53.897 --> 00:00:55.402
Pretty hyped about it.

00:00:55.402 --> 00:00:56.361
Can I even see myself?

00:00:56.361 --> 00:00:57.499
