go to Good Morning America.

00:01:01.033 --> 00:01:03.730
Be sure to look for me
on the show if you watch,

00:01:03.730 --> 00:01:04.717
or if your mom watches,

00:01:04.717 --> 00:01:05.986
or if you have family that watches,

00:01:05.986 --> 00:01:07.988
tell them that you know me.

00:01:07.988 --> 00:01:09.436
Tell them that we're friends,

00:01:09.436 --> 00:01:11.800
if you need me to send a tweet
to say that were friends,

00:01:11.800 --> 00:01:14.398
to confirm it, tweet me,
I will do that for you.

00:01:14.398 --> 00:01:15.231
Pencil.

00:01:16.351 --> 00:01:17.804
What did I call, did I
call it a pen earlier?

00:01:17.804 --> 00:01:19.279
