00:01:19.279 --> 00:01:21.102
I honestly don't know when
the last time was I slept.

00:01:21.102 --> 00:01:23.480
I think the last time I
slept was when (mumbles).

00:01:23.480 --> 00:01:25.075
That was a long time ago.

00:01:25.075 --> 00:01:25.908
iPad Pro.

00:01:26.812 --> 00:01:28.846
Smart Keyboard Folio!

00:01:28.846 --> 00:01:30.820
We've also got some dongles

00:01:30.820 --> 00:01:34.774
because something that's pretty
exciting about the iPad Pro

00:01:34.774 --> 00:01:36.355
