00:01:40.017 --> 00:01:42.967
So you can actually use your
iPad Pro to charge your iPhone.

00:01:42.967 --> 00:01:44.936
I need to take my shoes
off, I gotta get comfy.

00:01:44.936 --> 00:01:47.572
